    title: "taint drops every entry of an unstamped target-kind-gated primitive; io-boundaries selects its abstains_to row -- one catalogue, two answers (19 lost bufio sources on six repos, and every unstamped write sink once the seam is generalised)"  # 170c
    status: violated  # 170c
